   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Celui, celle, ceux, celles + relative",
     "texto": [
      "It is formed with **celui** (the one), **celle** (the one, feminine), **ceux** (those), **celles** (those, feminine) + **qui**, **que**, **dont** or **où**: **Celui qui parle est mon frère** (the one who is speaking is my brother).",
      "**Celle que j'aime est très belle** (the one I love is very beautiful)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Watch out",
     "texto": [
      "You do not say **celui parle**; it always needs the relative pronoun after it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
